Saltwater crocodiles do not live actively in the sea, their primary habitat is in estuaries north of Rockhampton.
A booking in advance gives the traveler the assurance that they will have a place to stay overnight after arriving at the destination.
Travel agencies often have agreements with specific hotels, although you may also be able to book other forms of accommodation, such as tent sites, through a travel agency.
Travel agencies usually offer packages that include breakfast, transport to and from the airport, or even a combination of flight and hotel.
You can also withhold your reservation for you if you need time to reconsider the offer or to procure further documents for your destination (e.g. visas).
However, any changes or inquiries should first be addressed to the travel agency and not directly to the hotel.
